nti: è davvero il padre? Perché si è rifatto vivo all'improvviso? I tre intraprendono un viaggio che li porterà lontano, verso un epilogo lacerante.","tagline":"Due fratelli adolescenti e il drammatico incontro con un padre finora sconosciuto."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Return","overview":"Two young brothers in contemporary Russia are reunited with a father they know only from an old photograph after his sudden return from a long absence. With their mother’s reluctant consent, they set out on a remote trip that quickly becomes an uneasy test of authority, trust, and masculinity. As the journey moves deeper into the wilderness, the fragile bonds between father and sons are pushed to their limits."},{"language":"ru-RU","title":"Возвращение","overview":"В жизни двух братьев неожиданно возникает отец, знакомый им только по фотографии десятилетней давности. Появление странного, чужого для них человека переворачивает их жизнь, когда отец вырывает ребят из привычного существования в тихом родном городе и привозит на заброшенный остров…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6qCXtQBbSl6e9qF7yv2BCbptbTr.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ULBp6mMRhpR6qnEqEWFbMdmdNq.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":11190,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6qCXtQBbSl6e9qF7yv2BCbptbTr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6qCXtQBbSl6e9qF7yv2BCbptbTr.jpg","language":"it","width":710,"height":1064},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6qCXtQBbSl6e9qF7yv2BCbptbTr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6qCXtQBbSl6e9qF7yv2BCbptbTr.jpg","language":"it","width":710,"height":1064},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hWNDbZxUbQavncwFniaFAiz0f0Z.jp